/target
.env
*.log

# Terraform: forks must not commit state (it can contain resolved values) or
# their own tfvars.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# Claude Code scratch state. `.claude/commands/` is intentionally tracked (the
# /fix-pr and /fix-pr-auto commands are shared tooling); worktrees are
# per-machine checkouts and are embedded git repos, which must never be
# committed into this one.
.claude/worktrees/
